      "description": "The weekly job\u2019s first successful run while unarmed deliberately skips the offsite mirror/reconcile. This code then creates `RECONCILE-ARMED` anyway, so a later scheduled run can perform the destructive `rclone sync` and purge without the required watched reconcile. Keep the arm file manual, or require and verify a watched reconcile before creating it.",
