    {
      "severity": "CONCERN",
      "title": "Offsite step ignores WAL push failures",
      "description": "`step_offsite` discards the result of the push command and proceeds to checks. The WAL check excludes segments younger than the elapsed push time plus the 120-second minimum age, so a failed push can leave a newly archived segment unchecked while the remaining data matches; the step can then pass despite an incomplete offsite copy. Check the push result and fail the step when it exits non-zero.",
